From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 13:57:11 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] protocol: serialize image compression control

VP_ANDROID_17_requirements lists VK_EXT_image_compression_control and its
swapchain companion, and both are struct-only: the first adds a feature
structure, a creation structure and a properties structure that a format or
image query returns, the second one more feature structure. The one command
the extension names, vkGetImageSubresourceLayout2EXT, is an alias of the core
vkGetImageSubresourceLayout2 and already has command type 282, so no command
identifier is needed.

Listing the two extensions is therefore the whole change. The generated
extension table grows from 201 entries to 203 and the codecs for the four
structures appear on both sides.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 vn_protocol.py | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/vn_protocol.py b/vn_protocol.py
index cb932afca427caff5d58fbecdf942f7113d172f7..f9cdf30e0f9b56cc0e5f29807ea0d8ca556d2fc5 100755
--- a/vn_protocol.py
+++ b/vn_protocol.py
@@ -178,6 +178,8 @@ VK_XML_EXTENSION_LIST = [
     'VK_EXT_global_priority_query',
     'VK_EXT_graphics_pipeline_library',
     'VK_EXT_image_2d_view_of_3d',
+    'VK_EXT_image_compression_control',
+    'VK_EXT_image_compression_control_swapchain',
     'VK_EXT_image_drm_format_modifier',
     'VK_EXT_image_sliced_view_of_3d',
     'VK_EXT_image_view_min_lod',
